  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>SkyGuide</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一個旨在以接近原版的方式改善 Hypixel SkyBlock 體驗的模組。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>目前功能</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SkyBlock 地圖，包含傳送門和 NPC。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/67508414/215343618-6c0f6818-df33-4d21-a63d-1927f8e4ec4d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"600\">可自訂的小地圖。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/67508414/215343639-fd39c6f8-244f-469c-857a-72816dda9815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"601\">智慧路徑點系統，能引導你前往傳送門以抵達目的地，或直接傳送到最近的傳送點。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fdiamond%253fr%253dSkyGuide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f8d261be-4548-4456-93f7-b3780517c6fd.webp\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/diamond\"></strong></a></p>",
